most-used default + cascading resolution — test record
========================================================
commit a18a8e4 (worktree default, uncommitted diff on top), machine lucien
nim 2.4.0, linux/amd64

Change under test
-----------------
- src/threecode/config.nim: usage ledger (usageLedgerPath,
  readProviderUsage, bumpProviderUsage, mostUsedCurrent) and
  resolveDefaultCurrent, the startup provider ladder in one proc:
  directory `.3code/config` store cascade (nearest ancestor wins, when
  it resolves) > config `current` (verbatim) > most-used ledger entry
  that still resolves > "" (buildProfile's first-[provider]-section
  floor).
- src/threecode.nim, src/threecode/library.nim: both startup sites call
  resolveDefaultCurrent; every session start bumps the profile it
  resolved onto the ledger (~/.local/share/3code/provider-usage).

