beats the ledger leader.

Why the old "always baseten glm-5.2 high" was seen
--------------------------------------------------
Not a system default: ~/p/3code/.3code/config held
`current = "baseten.zai-org/GLM-5.2"` (written by an earlier session's
:provider/:model switch there), and the store cascade propagated it to
every ~/p/3code subdirectory. "high" is glm-5.2's curated default
reasoning level. The no-pick floor used to be the first [provider]
section — file order, not usage; that floor is now the most-used ledger.
